<Window x:Class="EagleBoards.App.SettingsWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="Settings" Width="900" SizeToContent="Height" ResizeMode="NoResize"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner" ShowInTaskbar="False" FontSize="13">
  <DockPanel Margin="18,14">
    <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Margin="0,14,0,0">
      <Button DockPanel.Dock="Left" Content="Restore defaults" Padding="10,3" Click="OnDefaults" />
      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
        <TextBlock x:Name="ErrorText" Foreground="Firebrick" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0" />
        <Button Content="_Save" IsDefault="True" MinWidth="90" Padding="10,3" Click="OnSave" />
        <Button Content="Cancel" IsCancel="True" MinWidth="90" Padding="10,3" Margin="8,0,0,0" />
      </StackPanel>
    </DockPanel>

    <Grid>
      <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="1.3*" />
        <ColumnDefinition Width="16" />
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
        <ColumnDefinition Width="16" />
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
      </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

      <GroupBox Grid.Column="0" Header="Timers" Padding="8">
        <StackPanel>
          <Grid x:Name="TimerFields">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
              <ColumnDefinition Width="70" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          </Grid>
          <Border Background="#F6F5F1" BorderBrush="#E0DDD5" BorderThickness="1" Padding="10,8" Margin="0,10,0,0">
            <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" FontSize="12">
              <Bold>Where these defaults come from</Bold><LineBreak />
              Scouting America <Italic>Guide to Advancement</Italic>, Eagle Scout boards of review (8.0.3.0).<LineBreak /><LineBreak />
              <Bold>Convene Red: 30.</Bold> "Members should convene at least 30 minutes before the scheduled board of review"
              to go over the application, references and service project workbook (#8). Used as a cap: past it the candidate
              is being kept waiting, so the card turns red. No yellow stage; the window is a limit, not a target.<LineBreak /><LineBreak />
              <Bold>Final Yellow / Red: 30 and 45.</Bold> "Eagle boards generally last 30 minutes or somewhat longer ... but rarely
              should one last longer than 45 minutes" (#9). Counted from Start Review, when the youth is brought in.<LineBreak /><LineBreak />
              <Bold>Project Yellow / Red: 25 and 40.</Bold> District practice. A project proposal review is not a board of review,
              so the Guide sets no length for it.<LineBreak /><LineBreak />
              These are guidance, not hard limits: the colors prompt the room, and nothing stops a board that needs longer.
            </TextBlock>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </GroupBox>

      <GroupBox Grid.Column="2" Header="Row colors" Padding="8" VerticalAlignment="Top">
        <StackPanel x:Name="NormalColors" />
      </GroupBox>

      <GroupBox Grid.Column="4" Header="Selected row colors" Padding="8" VerticalAlignment="Top">
        <StackPanel x:Name="HighlightColors" />
      </GroupBox>
    </Grid>
  </DockPanel>
</Window>
